  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SAHRiNGON stands for the Southern African Human Rights NGO Network.   It exists to promote human rights in particular campaign against      death penalty, killings of albinos and shodow reporting on Tanzania&apos;s implementation of human rights conventions. Sida&apos;s support SAHRiNGON  three year strategic plan 2008-2010 amounts to MSEK 4.2</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">SAHRiNGON st&#xe5;r f&#xf6;r Southern African Human Rights NGO Network. Den    finns f&#xf6;r att fr&#xe4;mja m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttigheter, s&#xe4;rskilt kampen mot       d&#xf6;dsstraffet, morden p&#xe5; albiner och shodow rapportering om Tanzanias  genomf&#xf6;rande av konventioner om m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttigheter. Sidas st&#xf6;d     SAHRiNGON tre&#xe5;riga strategiska planen 2008-2010 uppg&#xe5;r till 4,2 MSEK</narrative>
  </description>
